{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22323","headline":"早秋曲江感怀 · 白居易","name":"早秋曲江感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离离暑云散，嫋嫋凉风起。\n池上秋又来，荷花半成子。\n朱颜易销歇，白日无穷已。\n人寿不如山，年光忽於水。\n青芜与红蓼，岁岁秋相似。\n去岁此悲秋，今秋复来此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}